Welcome to Isotope: niri and Noctalia on Wayland, built from source on Kairos.

  Containers : docker run …   ·   distrobox enter
  Apps       : flatpak search <name>   ·   flatpak install flathub <id>
  Updates    : tray icon   ·   isotope   ·   isotope upgrade
  Backups    : isotope backup init <dir>   ·   isotope backup
  Shortcuts  : Super+F1
